  "description": "Proposed refurbishment and alteration of the Register Office facilities within the Town Hall, including the Alexandra, Victoria and Elizabeth Ceremony Rooms, the General Register Office, the Senior Registrar's Office, Room 14 and the existing gentlemen's toilets. Works include replacement flooring, redecoration, new wall coverings, refurbishment of existing chandeliers and windows, upgraded LED lighting, minor internal alterations to Room 14, including removal of an internal wall to create a new waiting area, and reconfiguration of the existing gentlemen's toilets to provide accessible, gender-neutral and female WC facilities, together with associated mechanical and electrical works.",
